<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/3rd-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Hormozdgan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/224">224 CE</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/3rd-century">3rd century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Hormozdgan was fought in 224 CE between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ardashir-i">Ardashir I</a> and the Parthian king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/artabanus-iv">Artabanus IV</a>. Artabanus was killed, and Ardashir was soon crowned <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/negus-nagast">king of kings</a>. The battle ended the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/parthian-empire">Parthian Empire</a> and founded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-hormozdgan.jpg" alt="Battle of Hormozdgan" width="320" height="132" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Eugène Flandin · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ardachir_relief_Firuzabad_1.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
